<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Modon Has Received Your Expression of Interest {!relatedTo.EOIId__c}" recipientType="Contact" relatedToType="Expressionofinterest__c">
<messaging:plainTextEmailBody >
Dear {!recipient.Name},

Thank you for submitting your expression of interest in {!relatedTo.ProjectName__c} from Modon. We have successfully received your {!relatedTo.EOIId__c}.

We will contact you soon for the next steps. If you have any further queries, please do not hesitate to contact your assigned sales consultant.

Thank you for choosing Modon.

Warm regards,

Modon Sales Team 
</messaging:plainTextEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>